{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras/02e692de12274b589da7a840aa247f6c.avif?t=1759308784\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras_big/02e692de12274b589da7a840aa247f6c.avif?t=1759308784 width=800 height=432 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glide BTL - the future is here!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the future, where you're about to become a freelancer -  Glide Operator: a revolutionary unmanned craft. Challenge the world - dive into epic battles, high-speed races, capture-the-flag missions and prove that you deserve to be number one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GlideBTL is a competitive multiplayer action game set in cyberpunk, where speed, teamwork<strong>, </strong>and tactics are crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras/9bd794bc9bdc1f0a8d4484dc5dbe565f.poster.avif?t=1759308784\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras/9bd794bc9bdc1f0a8d4484dc5dbe565f.webm?t=1759308784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras/9bd794bc9bdc1f0a8d4484dc5dbe565f.mp4?t=1759308784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive in the world of cyberpunk!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an era, when nations have lost interest in directly resolving conflicts and gradually handed over governance to corporate entities, power now lies in the hands of corps capable of managing crises efficiently and flexibely using cutting-edge technologies. They have gained full independence by hiring highly motivated freelance specialists to operate glides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In today's world, freelancing is not just a stable income - it's a chance to make a real impact on the future. By choosing contracts from corporations, you're not only securing a steady income but also influencing the resolution of global conflicts and helping to shape decisions that could alter the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras/4c0a5f7673668a0e85057b9ea38afb75.poster.avif?t=1759308784\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras/4c0a5f7673668a0e85057b9ea38afb75.webm?t=1759308784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694110/extras/4c0a5f7673668a0e85057b9ea38afb75.mp4?t=1759308784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize everything \u2014 from core stats to hull colors!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your perfect glide to match your unique style. Using modifier system, you can tweak various attributes - such as agility, power or speed. Each modifier not only changes the technical specs but also visually transforms your glide, adding elements that highlight your enhanced abilities. Beyond functional tuning, full visual customization is also available. Choose a unique color scheme, apply exclusive skins, and create a look that becomes your signature in-game. Your imagination is the only limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Tahomo Games - a developers team united by a single goal: to create a game that earns a place in players' hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to begin your journey to the major league?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.st